<Base title="German Lesson 7: Farben" description="Self-paced beginner German lesson 7: Colours."><main class="lesson"><a class="back" href="/resources/german-async">← Back to the German learning path</a><p class="eyebrow">GERMAN · A1 · UNIT 1 · LESSON 07</p><h1 lang="de">Farben</h1><p class="subtitle">Colours</p><p>Learn common colour words and practise describing things around you.</p><section class="panel"><h2>Words and phrases</h2><ul class="vocab"><li><strong>rot</strong><span>red</span></li><li><strong>blau</strong><span>blue</span></li><li><strong>grün</strong><span>green</span></li><li><strong>gelb</strong><span>yellow</span></li><li><strong>schwarz</strong><span>black</span></li><li><strong>weiß</strong><span>white</span></li><li><strong>orange</strong><span>orange</span></li><li><strong>rosa</strong><span>pink</span></li><li><strong>braun</strong><span>brown</span></li><li><strong>lila</strong><span>purple</span></li></ul></section><section class="panel"><h2>Practise at your own pace</h2><ol><li>Name five colours you can see around you.</li><li>Describe three objects: <strong>Das Buch ist blau.</strong></li><li>Ask: <strong>Welche Farbe ist das?</strong></li></ol></section><nav class="lesson-nav"><a href="/resources/german-async">All lessons</a></nav></main></Base><style>.lesson{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:55px 24px 90px;color:#243d35}.back{font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:underline}.eyebrow{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;margin-top:42px}h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,7vw,4.5rem);margin:12px 0}.subtitle{font-size:1.4rem;color:#567047}.lesson>p{line-height:1.7}.panel{margin-top:32px;background:#f7f6ee;border:1px solid #dce1d6;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}h2{font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px}.videos{display:grid;gap:18px}iframe{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border:0;border-radius:12px}.vocab{list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:12px}.vocab li{padding:12px;background:white;border-radius:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}ol{padding-left:22px;line-height:2}.lesson-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-top:30px}.lesson-nav a{color:#304e3d;text-decoration:underline}</style>